@page "/privacy"
@layout PublicLayout

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy — Muster</PageTitle>

<div class="panel glass">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Draft — to be finalized before public launch.</em></p>

    <h2>What we store</h2>
    <p>Muster stores Discord identifiers (guild, user, role ids), display names, and participation
       records (voice attendance, missions, musters, awards) needed to run leaderboards and rewards.
       We do not read or store message content.</p>

    <h2>Your data</h2>
    <p>Server admins can remove members and data through the bot and web app. Requests for data export
       or deletion can be made to the server's administrators.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>This page will host the full policy and contact details before launch.</p>
</div>
